pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: left-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 60, 4, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 55, 500, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>方向03 总结</strong></p>
  - elementId: summary-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [80, 110, 1100, 530]
    columnWidths: [0.22, 0.40, 0.38]
    rowHeights: [0.12, 0.22, 0.22, 0.22, 0.22]
    style: "$default"
    rows:
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p><strong>论文</strong></p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p><strong>核心思想</strong></p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p><strong>主要局限</strong></p>
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p>Li 2022 CCA</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>Realm/RME/RMM/GPT/lifecycle 核心设计</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>论文原型不等同于后续规范或量产实现</p>
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p>Arm CCA 规范</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>CCA 接口/Realm/memory/attestation 语义</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>不是性能、可用性或具体实现正确性的证据</p>
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p>Arm RMM 规范</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>RMM 接口/RMI/RSI/lifecycle 定义</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>不证明任一 RMM 实现正确</p>
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p><strong>03 Takeaway</strong></p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p><strong>三篇共同建立演进关系</strong></p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p><strong>用证据等级控制机制、实验和商业化结论</strong></p>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 660, 1100, 25]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>来源：三篇主讲材料选择、评价字段与 evidence ledger</p>
